                    {
                        "translation_id": "2d1b1fa3-4816-43fe-b7b7-f4789c01ec76",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b9f0801-1531-3187-8877-7da44e3abfbf",
                        "source_sense_id": "bac38ae8-405b-3bd8-834b-c70f12440016",
                        "source_sense_description": "stuip, toeval",
                        "target_lang_word": "convulsion",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "convulsion",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba19dab7-11b5-3621-ade3-7a130c00f698",
                                        "entry_id": "d25de0b6-cb76-3937-8b42-bbeb9184c974",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An intense, paroxysmal, involuntary muscular contraction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5bc545df-939e-45a4-8d9f-ac215773675b",
                                                "sense_id": "ba19dab7-11b5-3621-ade3-7a130c00f698",
                                                "text": "1850-1859, Charles Dickens, Household Words\nThat immortal creature had gone over the proofs with great pains — had of course taken out the stiflings — hard-plungings, lungeings, and other convulsions — and had also taken out her weakenings and damagings of her own effects."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "56844bb9-96fd-36bc-99ac-d2cd044da276",
                                        "entry_id": "d25de0b6-cb76-3937-8b42-bbeb9184c974",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An uncontrolled fit, as of laughter; a paroxysm."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9484a4f6-570e-3508-a78c-8fc55a4beba2",
                                        "entry_id": "d25de0b6-cb76-3937-8b42-bbeb9184c974",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Violent turmoil."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f810d7e7-7c5b-4292-809c-f49172293089",
                                                "sense_id": "9484a4f6-570e-3508-a78c-8fc55a4beba2",
                                                "text": "Earthquakes and convulsions of nature shake Earth on a regular basis."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f591295-18d6-4bdb-997d-fcb056ecf0cb",
                                                "sense_id": "9484a4f6-570e-3508-a78c-8fc55a4beba2",
                                                "text": "It would seem as if calm were necessary to convulsion; for the tranquillity of the last few months was again to be disturbed by political commotion."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb236d51-76ba-46d0-90ca-b694b8c5ecdf",
                                                "sense_id": "9484a4f6-570e-3508-a78c-8fc55a4beba2",
                                                "text": "In a convulsion that has caught many in Brazil and beyond by surprise, waves of protesters denounced their leaders for dedicating so many resources to cultivating Brazil’s global image by building stadiums for international events, when basic services like education and health care remain woefully inadequate."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5633241-4391-3db8-9309-86b6fa787183",
                                        "entry_id": "d25de0b6-cb76-3937-8b42-bbeb9184c974",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hysteric in nature."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "40b4e400-8467-4a46-b1a4-039bbd54a61a",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b9f0801-1531-3187-8877-7da44e3abfbf",
                        "source_sense_id": "bac38ae8-405b-3bd8-834b-c70f12440016",
                        "source_sense_description": "stuip, toeval",
                        "target_lang_word": "convulsion",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "convulsion",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ff9c9e6-cfe8-3a6d-ad04-90b93e867496",
                                        "entry_id": "b0449185-6465-306a-866f-15d087300b6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Contraction violente et involontaire d’un ou plusieurs muscles, d’un ou plusieurs membres, voire de tout le corps."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3bd5d12-5002-43b3-af62-6ca2bcbeeb2d",
                                                "sense_id": "9ff9c9e6-cfe8-3a6d-ad04-90b93e867496",
                                                "text": "Ses lèvres pâles comme son teint indiquèrent une convulsion domptée par l’énergie bretonne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "32b241ed-5917-45c8-9c92-86a872c923f2",
                                                "sense_id": "9ff9c9e6-cfe8-3a6d-ad04-90b93e867496",
                                                "text": "— Tu crois, mon garçon, que je vais prendre à mon service un vilain animal comme toi, qui fera mourir de peur ma femme et mes servantes, tomber en convulsions mes enfants !"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39a7f4a4-663b-47e8-aff1-04d9c6ab85d6",
                                                "sense_id": "9ff9c9e6-cfe8-3a6d-ad04-90b93e867496",
                                                "text": "M. Vulpian a vu que, chez des animaux empoisonnés par la strychnine, lorsque la dose de poison n’était pas trop forte, les convulsions trop énergiques, l’appareil respiratoire échappait à l’action convulsivante du poison."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f5b6ab6-f91a-4f40-ac58-b196dfe28ef0",
                                                "sense_id": "9ff9c9e6-cfe8-3a6d-ad04-90b93e867496",
                                                "text": "Le rire dégénere quelquefois en convulsion ; cela n’est pas surprenant, puisqu’il n’est lui-même qu’une espèce de convulsion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5d74705e-08cf-3d27-be3c-5b031060cf07",
                                        "entry_id": "b0449185-6465-306a-866f-15d087300b6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Grands troubles qui agitent les États."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "df286583-823d-4ce8-9f94-717ec85aba01",
                                                "sense_id": "5d74705e-08cf-3d27-be3c-5b031060cf07",
                                                "text": "Les seigneurs, […], avaient maintenant repris leur ancienne licence dans toute son étendue, […] s’efforçant, par tous les moyens possibles, de se mettre chacun à la tête de forces suffisantes pour jouer un rôle dans les convulsions nationales qui semblaient imminentes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "aa5fa8c4-22a2-46df-98df-b3b8c38491da",
                                                "sense_id": "5d74705e-08cf-3d27-be3c-5b031060cf07",
                                                "text": "Le XIVᵉ siècle […] s’achève, ainsi qu’il a préludé, se tord dans des convulsions religieuses atroces."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "266815a8-9f15-323f-bd56-a6547f62a755",
                                        "entry_id": "b0449185-6465-306a-866f-15d087300b6e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Secousse sismique."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9e844fcb-92ae-46d0-996b-4d547dcddcae",
                                                "sense_id": "266815a8-9f15-323f-bd56-a6547f62a755",
                                                "text": "D'énormes blocs de corail éblouissants de blancheur sortaient de l'eau et semblaient les débris d'une gigantesque convulsion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
